{"step_index":116,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:23:29Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-17T14:23:29Z\nCompleted At: 2026-08-17T14:23:33Z\n\n\t\t\t\tThe command exited with code 0.\n\t\t\t\tOutput:\n\t\t\t\tReplace text in document\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  gdocs mutate replace [docID] [old] [new] [flags]\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  gdocs mutate replace DOC_ID \"old text\" \"new text\"\r\n  gdocs mutate replace DOC_ID \"old\" \"new\" --tab TAB_ID\r\n  gdocs mutate replace DOC_ID \"old\" \"new\" --direct\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n      --direct       apply the change directly instead of suggesting\r\n  -h, --help         help for replace\r\n      --tab string   tab ID to restrict the replacement to (see list-tabs); child tabs are not included\r\n\r\nGlobal Flags:\r\n      --json                 output in JSON format\r\n      --legacy-mode string   Legacy commands mode (allowed|deprecated|banned) (default \"deprecated\")\r\nSed-style operations: substitution, delete, append, insert, positional\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n  gdocs mutate sed [docID] [expression...] [flags]\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/old text/new text/g'\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/Draft/Final/' -i\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID -e 's/foo/bar/g' -e 's/baz/qux/'\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID -f edits.sed\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/old/new/' --first         # replace first occurrence only\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/old/new/' --dry-run        # preview without applying\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/old/new/' --tab TAB_ID     # target specific tab\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/\\d{4}-\\d{2}/DATE/' --regex # regex pattern matching\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID '3s/old/new/'              # addressed: paragraph 3 only\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID '2,5s/old/new/'            # addressed: paragraphs 2-5\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID '3d'                        # delete paragraph 3\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID '3a\\new text'               # append after paragraph 3\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID '3i\\new text'               # insert before paragraph 3\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/^/prepend text/'         # prepend to doc\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/$/append text/'          # append to doc\r\n  gdocs mutate sed DOC_ID 's/^$//'                    # clear doc\r\n\r\nFlags:\r\n      --bold                 apply bold styling to matched text (use with pattern only, e.g. s/pattern//)\r\n  -i, --case-insensitive     case-insensitive matching\r\n      --dry-run              preview changes without applying\r\n  -e, --expression strings   sed expression (repeatable)\r\n  -f, --file string          read sed expressions from file (one per line, # comments)\r\n      --first                replace only the first occurrence\r\n  -h, --help                 help for sed\r\n      --regex                treat pattern as regex (RE2 syntax)\r\n      --tab string           target a specific tab by ID (see list-tabs)\r\n\r\nGlobal Flags:\r\n      --json                 output in JSON format\r\n      --legacy-mode string   Legacy commands mode (allowed|deprecated|banned) (default \"deprecated\")\r\n\n"}
