{"step_index":125,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-17T14:23:57Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"BypassSandbox":true,"CommandLine":"/google/bin/releases/gemini-agents-gdocs/gdocs mutate replace 1tHkqwbPOJ2HUlmTliaR-Ip0gnpAhxiIrXKcJxu0qlT4 \"To ensure strict enterprise governance and zero-trust security, this solution will be deployed on a secure, scalable agent orchestration platform, enforce traceably bounded execution, authenticate the automation's origin for all backend operations, and dynamically validate all interactions to protect against malicious instruction overrides and safeguard sensitive information.\" \"To ensure strict enterprise governance and zero-trust security during the MVP 1 phase, the solution deploys an API Gateway Mock Identity Assertion Layer (signed JWT session claims via X-Authenticated-User) that binds conversational turns to authenticated employee profiles. The system enforces traceably bounded execution, authenticates automation origins for all backend operations, and dynamically validates interactions with probabilistic safety benchmarks (>= 99.5% precision/recall) to protect against malicious instruction overrides and safeguard sensitive information.\" --tab t.tpcr3esq94y","Cwd":"/google/src/cloud/gauravrawat/summarize_latest_chats/google3","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Applying suggested replacement on Executive Summary","toolSummary":"Suggest edit on Executive Summary"}}]}
